    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP 1D</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Unbounded knapsack (count)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/coin-change-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 518</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Coin Change II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Count combinations, not orderings. Add coins one at a time: for each coin c (outer loop), for a from c up to amount, ways[a] += ways[a - c]. Coins outer means each multiset is built in coin order exactly once; amounts outer would count 1+2 and 2+1 separately. O(amount · coins) time, O(amount) space.</p>\n"
  },
